    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425480/extras/gif_large_opti2.gif?t=1684936113\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape Your Destiny</h2><br>Welcome to Dead Shapes, an action 2D side scroller rogue-lite that will test your skills and keep you on the edge of your seat. <br>As a rectangle on a mission, you'll journey through randomly generated levels filled with enemies, traps, and secrets.<br><br>Dead Shapes offers fast-paced combat, responsive controls, and endless replayability. Each playthrough is unique, with levels and rewards generated in real-time to keep you engaged and pushing your limits.<br><br>Fight to stay alive, collect power-ups, and become the ultimate shape!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425480/extras/4ced8970cee9bcd6a2d115193f561861.poster.avif?t=1684936113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425480/extras/4ced8970cee9bcd6a2d115193f561861.webm?t=1684936113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425480/extras/4ced8970cee9bcd6a2d115193f561861.mp4?t=1684936113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425480/extras/gif_large_opti2.gif?t=1684936113\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape Your Destiny</h2><br>Welcome to Dead Shapes, an action 2D side scroller rogue-lite that will test your skills and keep you on the edge of your seat. <br>As a rectangle on a mission, you'll journey through randomly generated levels filled with enemies, traps, and secrets.<br><br>Dead Shapes offers fast-paced combat, responsive controls, and endless replayability. Each playthrough is unique, with levels and rewards generated in real-time to keep you engaged and pushing your limits.<br><br>Fight to stay alive, collect power-ups, and become the ultimate shape!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425480/extras/4ced8970cee9bcd6a2d115193f561861.poster.avif?t=1684936113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425480/extras/4ced8970cee9bcd6a2d115193f561861.webm?t=1684936113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425480/extras/4ced8970cee9bcd6a2d115193f561861.mp4?t=1684936113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
